      "id": "2026-10-15-s1",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "travel",
      "title_zh": "山上很冷",
      "title_en": "It's cold up the mountain",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["上", "个", "月", "，", "我", "和", "朋友", "去", "山", "上", "玩", "。", "我们", "早上", "六", "点", "就", "走", "了", "。"],
        ["那里", "很", "高", "，", "我们", "走", "了", "四", "个", "小时", "。"],
        ["山", "上", "非常", "冷", "！", "我", "穿", "了", "很", "多", "，", "还是", "很", "冷", "。"],
        ["最后", "，", "我们", "到", "了", "。", "我们", "能", "看到", "很", "多", "地方", "，", "都", "笑", "了", "。"],
        ["朋友", "说", "：", "“", "下", "次", "我们", "再", "来", "！", "”", "我", "说", "：", "“", "好", "！", "我", "也", "想", "再", "来", "。", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Last month my friend and I went up a mountain. We set off at six in the morning.",
        "It was very high — we walked for four hours.",
        "It was really cold at the top! I was wearing lots of layers but I was still cold.",
        "In the end we got there. We could see so many places, and we both smiled.",
        "My friend said: “Let’s come again next time!” I said: “Yes! I want to come back too.”"
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["山", "早上", "冷"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "山", "english": "mountain" },
        { "word": "早上", "english": "morning" },
        { "word": "冷", "english": "cold" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-15-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "football",
      "title_zh": "一个小球迷",
      "title_en": "A young fan",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "常", "和", "朋友", "一起", "玩", "球", "。", "我们", "都", "很", "爱", "曼联", "。"],
        ["今天", "，", "一", "个", "孩子", "问", "我", "：", "“", "你", "最", "喜欢", "谁", "？", "”"],
        ["我", "回答", "：", "“", "我", "最", "喜欢", "曼联", "的", "十", "号", "！", "”"],
        ["孩子", "说", "：", "“", "我", "也", "是", "！", "”", "他", "还", "记得", "十", "号", "去年", "进", "了", "二十", "个", "球", "。"],
        ["我们", "一起", "玩", "了", "一", "个", "小时", "。", "他", "跑", "起来", "很", "快", "！", "我", "很", "高兴", "认识", "了", "他", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I often play football with my friends. We all love Man United.",
        "Today a kid asked me: “Who’s your favourite?”",
        "I answered: “My favourite is Man United’s number 10!”",
        "The kid said: “Me too!” He even remembered that number 10 scored twenty goals last year.",
        "We played together for an hour. He runs really fast! I’m really glad I met him."
      ],
      "names": ["曼联"],
      "new_words": ["常", "回答"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "常", "english": "often" },
        { "word": "回答", "english": "to answer" },
        { "word": "曼联", "english": "Manchester United" }
      ]
    }
